Recommends: kwalletmanager | gnome-keyring | keepassxc, kscreen
Description: Watch your Emby library on the big screen
 StrmQt is a native Qt 6 client for Emby media servers, built for KDE Plasma
 and designed to be driven from the couch with a remote, a gamepad, or the
 keyboard.
